# needs-native-review: the guide's rules, her advice and the money dial, 28 Nov 2026
msgctxt "guide dock, her advice: nothing was prepared and the person makes the change"
msgid "I have prepared nothing here, and nothing has changed. If you agree, you make this change yourself."
msgstr "No he preparado nada aquí, y nada ha cambiado. Si está de acuerdo, este cambio lo hace usted."

# needs-native-review: the guide's rules, her advice and the money dial, 28 Nov 2026
msgctxt "guide dock, her advice: nothing was prepared and the person makes the change, brief"
msgid "Nothing prepared. Yours to change."
msgstr "Nada preparado. El cambio es suyo."
